# Check every function before sending (HARD)

**Owner 2026-08-21:** *"stop sending me anything until you check everything. Make a rule that you check every function before sending to me."*

## Before ANY reply with a preview / Editor / Pages URL

1. List every clickable on the changed surface (footer, header, tiles, CTAs, Help ▾).
2. `curl -sI -L` each href on `barreletics.com` with the preview cookie. Final status must be **200**.
3. If a label is a hub (Collaborations, Partner programs, Help), the href must be that **hub page** — not a single product, not `/`, not a 404.
4. Open the hub HTML and confirm the tiles/CTAs on **that** page also 200.
5. **No URL in chat** until the full list is 200. A 404 = fix first, then re-test the whole list.

## Forbidden

- Sending a link after checking only the one you just made
- HTTP 200 on a product when the label is a category/hub
- Assuming Admin menus exist — verify the **rendered** href in the HTML

## Hub pages look like Help

Tile cards (`page-help`) → real existing destinations. Do not invent a different landing layout.
